  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tgq23EN.png\" alt=\"YUNG的下界堡垒改良\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"依赖于YUNG的API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入Discord上的YUNG帮派！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在Twitter上关注我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"订阅我的YouTube！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/brWx8ey.png\" alt=\"这是什么？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p><strong>全面重做Minecraft下界堡垒！</strong> YUNG的Better Nether Fortresses从零开始重新设计了下界堡垒。与原版相比，改良后的堡垒更大、更复杂、奖励更丰富。每座堡垒由三部分组成——桥梁网络、主堡和深入地下延伸的熔岩大厅。<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>YUNG的Better Nether Fortresses还内置了与Create模组的兼容性！</strong>如果你正在使用Create模组，堡垒的某些部分有概率生成Create风格的建筑。请注意，这是一个可选功能——运行此模组不需要Create模组。请确保使用适用于你的Minecraft版本的Create模组最新版本！注意：此功能仅适用于1.19.2及以上版本。</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/omRqM-gZBAg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3wUhXJJ.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>YUNG的Better Nether Fortresses旨在与所有世界生成模组完全兼容，包括：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-ocean-monuments\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的Better Ocean Monuments</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-witch-huts\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的Better Witch Huts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的Extras</a></li>\n<li>地狱扩张及下界生物群系类模组</li>\n<li>天启堡垒：AF堡垒将与改良堡垒一同生成</li>\n<li>逝去下界：改良堡垒将取代逝去下界中增强的原版堡垒</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用优惠码YUNGNICKYOUNG在Bisect Hosting享受25%折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
